{"availability":"available","full":"elkimek/get-based","name":"get-based","description":"Private, local-first health intelligence for labs, 51 curated SNPs, wearables, light exposure, Biology Scores, optional AI, encrypted sync, sharing, and Agent Access.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"TypeScript","stars":145,"forks":27,"created":"2026-02-14T11:38:30Z","updated":"2026-10-05T13:16:50Z","license":"AGPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://getbased.health","topics":["ai","biomarker-tracking","biomarkers","blood-test","blood-work","dashboard","dna","evidence-based","free","genetics","health","health-dashboard","lab-results","local-first","open-source","pdf-import","privacy-first","pwa","self-hosted","snp"],"demo":"https://app.getbased.health/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T20:12:33.863Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-07T20:12:33.863Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-07T20:12:33.863Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T19:07:46.631Z","stars":144,"forks":27},{"at":"2026-10-07T20:12:33.863Z","stars":145,"forks":27}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["getbased is an open-source health dashboard for people who want to understand their own biology without handing the whole record to a black-box health app. It brings labs, DNA, wearables, light exposure, lifestyle context, notes, and optional AI analysis into one browser-based workspace.","You can use it with no account. Most data lives in your browser by default. Health-data network features — AI providers, encrypted sync, profile sharing, external Knowledge Bases, and Agent Access — are opt-in. On the hosted app, cookieless anonymous pageview and outbound affiliate-click counts are enabled by default; they contain no health data and can be disabled in Settings → Privacy."],"features":["Import lab reports — drop PDFs, images, spreadsheets, or manually enter values. getbased maps known markers, lets you review values, laboratory ranges, collection time, and fasting status before saving, and keeps…","Track biomarkers over time — 198 built-in markers across 19 categories, plus specialty and custom markers, with charts, tables, heatmaps, lab-first and context-aware ranges, optional evidence-backed optimal ranges,…","Use calculated markers without duplicates — supported lab-reported ratios and indices take priority, while deterministic fallbacks cover lipid/metabolic ratios, NLR/PLR/MLR/SII, FIB-4, anion gap, free water deficit, and…","Explore 19 Biology Scores — deterministic scores keep affordable core markers central, with optional markers adding context. Biological Coherence brings eligible baseline scores together and shows which contribute or…","Bring in DNA context — raw DNA imports from common consumer and clinical formats, with curated SNP interpretation, APOE haplotype support, mtDNA haplogroups, and DNA-aware AI context."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/elkimek/get-based/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"e8a8b8ecff34adbdebca5e0e081d24c36ca29b3797dee701123c7b64423eb940","extractedAt":"2026-10-05T19:07:46.831Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T19:07:46.831Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"getbased is an open-source health dashboard for people who want to understand their own biology without handing the whole record to a black-box health app. It brings labs, DNA, wearables, light exposure, lifestyle context, notes, and optional AI analysis into one browser-based workspace.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/elkimek/get-based/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"You can use it with no account.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/elkimek/get-based/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"The hosted cloud integrations use narrowly scoped provider relays; WHOOP, Ultrahuman, and Google Health remain self-host only and use infrastructure controlled by that deployment.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/elkimek/get-based/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"not_required","text":"No account required.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/elkimek/get-based/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"hosting","status":"optional","text":"Deterministic patterns and an optional trusted self-hosted model can strip likely identifiers before lab text is sent to an AI provider.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/elkimek/get-based/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"Self-hosting operators using Anthropic Console/API billing may expose the adapter as Claude Agent by starting or installing the companion with GETBASEDENABLECLAUDEAGENT=api-console; then sign in with claude auth login --console.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/elkimek/get-based/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"e8a8b8ecff34adbdebca5e0e081d24c36ca29b3797dee701123c7b64423eb940","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/elkimek/get-based/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T19:07:46.832Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-05T13:16:50Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/elkimek/get-based/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T19:07:46.833Z","hash":"e8a8b8ecff34adbdebca5e0e081d24c36ca29b3797dee701123c7b64423eb940","originalBytes":32724,"storedBytes":32724,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["run","npm","local","typescript","optional","app","browser","server","data","health","context","getbased","test","check","provider","agent","encrypted","runs","separate","service","sync","build","compatibility","coverage","light","production","profile","ranges","tests","without","api","before","companion","features","knowledge","only","playwright","relay","release","scores","chat","checks","deployment","endpoint","firefox","selected","text","typecheck","biology","does","full","hosted","import","keep","manual","markers","model","modules","notes","providers","pwa","remain","sources","supported","temporary","when","while","access","after","chromium","credentials"